"""10 original PTE Core Write Email items.

Format from Pearson's PTE Core test format (Speaking & Writing) and Score Guide
(January 2024): a situation of up to 100 words with three bullet points, 9
minutes, Form full marks at 50-120 words. Everyday settings, not academic ones.
"""

